<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark March 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark March 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim &amp; Cie.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON    *3.50 PCT  MATURITY    24.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0375  PAY DATE    24 SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FROM 24.SEPT.96 - 23.MAR.97, THEREAFTER 4.25 PCT</p>
<p>		 FROM 24.MAR.97 - 24.MAR.99</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    HANNOVER  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.1375    PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		THE ISSUER HAS THE RIGHT TO CALL THE BOND ONLY ON</p>
<p>		24.MAR.97 AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
